      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request Rate by Code",
      "description": "Every RPC by its result code, OK included. Grouped by code, never by the status label beside it, which is free text. A denial is not an error. CanQuery, HasPermission and IsDatasourceMember answer a refused caller with allowed=false and code 0, so a user being told no counts as OK everywhere on this board.",
